1. Target Outcomes
Build two production-grade, playbook-driven solutions:

• Capacity Planning
• Resiliency Test Engineering (PTAAS: Playbook/Test-As-A-Service)
Solution

Target outcome

Capacity Planning

Ingest the last 3 months of Prometheus, Splunk, and incident data (ServiceNow details). Analyze CPU average and p99, along with supporting metrics, and classify services as under-utilized, over-utilized, or unstable / dependency-induced stress. Produce evidence-backed recommendations at component level.

Resiliency Test Engineering (PTAAS)

Discover resilience capabilities implemented in components. Evaluate what is allocated vs what is actually needed, especially OCP resources and controls. Execute resilience tests through Net Havoc playbooks. Publish validated resilience posture and gaps.

 

