scenario_id, fault_type, target_component, start/end time, expected_behavior vs observed_behavior, pass/fail, blast_radius, recovery_time_sec, evidence artifacts (logs, traces, metric snapshots).

OCP / K8s controls

cpu/memory requests-limits, liveness/readiness/startup probe configs, HPA/VPA configs and stabilization windows, pod disruption budget (PDB), anti-affinity/topology spread settings if used.

Dependency awareness

critical upstreams/downstreams, single-point-of-failure markers, chain-level resilience score.

 

